perficial margin measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 7cm  The closest margin is 0 3cm from the superficial margin  skin   Parenchyma surrounding that biopsy cavity is firm and yellow and grossly unremarkable  The biopsy cavity is filled with old hemorrhage  There is another small biopsy cavity centrally located measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm filled with old hemorrhage  The parenchyma surrounding it is grossly unremarkable  The closest margin is 0 9cm from the superior margin  Next to this biopsy cavity site there is a small irregular whitish yellow mass with a small amount of punctate hemorrhage in the middle measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  The mass extends to within 0 9cm of the superficial margin  skin  and superior margins  Section code  A and B  biopsy cavity site at medial deep margin with closest margin  deep  C  firm hemorrhagic area abutting deep inferior margin D and E  deep biopsy cavity with adjacent white mass F  biopsy cavity with mass in relation to the lateral margin G  representative sections of detached piece of skin Resident  DAVID SABLE  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART   RIGHT SIMPLE MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Unchecked.
