ity is lined by a dark red hemorrhagic lining and lies 0 3cm from anterior  0 5cm from superior  1 6cm from posterior  2 0cm from inferior  0 5cm from lateral  and 3 0cm from medial margin  The surrounding breast parenchyma shows fat necrosis  The entire specimen is sequentially submitted from medial to lateral as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Section code   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   En face section  medial margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Sequential cross section with entire first cavity as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Cross section containing thick segment of needle localization wire   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire second cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Radial section  lateral margin  Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   BREAST  LEFT   EXCISION  report_end  , Unchecked.
