t specimen measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm and in the central   lateral aspect of it  there is a cavity that measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  The specimen is inked as follows  anterior blue  posterior  black  medial green  and lateral  yellow  The specimen is serially sectioned along the superior inferior axis  Upon cut sectioning  an ill defined  white solid area is localized abutting the medial margin and focally the posterior one  The other resection margins appear to be 0 1cm away from fibrotic white area  The specimen is entirely submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final medial margin  is an oriented  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm fibrotic shaved margin with a stitch indicating the final margin  The final margin is now inked black  The specimen is serially sectioned along the long axis and entirely submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast final superior margin  are two oriented fibrofatty breast shave margins with black stitches  The larger shaved margin is REMOVED_DATE x 1 0x 0 5cm with a black stitch indicating the final margin  that is now inked in black  The smaller shaved margin is REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  with a stitch indicating the final margin  This true margin is now inked in black  Both oriented specimens are serially sectioned and entirely submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Smaller shaved oriented specimen   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Larger shaved oriented specimen  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast re excision  2  is an unoriented REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm aggregate of fibrofatty breast tissue  The larger fragment of this aggregate has a cavity wall of REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  The larger specimen measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 