f yellow fibrofatty tissue with prominent firm white fibrous bands and streaks of hemorrhage  Representative sections are submitted as follows  A  mass in relation to closest margin  posterior and inferior margins   B  mass in relation to posterior and superior margin  The mass in the central portion of the specimen with respect to medial and lateral ends of the specimen  C  edge of the mass in relation to the inferior and anterior margins  D  Edge of the mass in relation the superior and anterior margins  E  mass in relation to anterior and inferior margins F  Mass in relation to inferior and posterior margin G  Superior and anterior margin in the regions of the tumor but not grossly including the tumor mass  H  The superior and posterior margin in the area of the tumor but not including the tumor mass grossly  I  tumor in relation to posterior and inferior margins  J  tumor in relation to anterior and inferior margins  K  superior and anterior margins in the area of the tumor but not grossly including the tumor mass  L  superior and posterior margins in the region of the tumor but not grossly including the tumor mass  M  section containing small firm yellow nodules growing along a fibrous septum  the section contains the posterior and superior margins and is slightly towards the lateral end of the specimen  N  The lateral edge of the specimen submitted en face  O  Representative section of tissue not containing tumor mass but grossly containing white fibrous septae and hemorrhage  taken from the medial aspect of the specimen and including the superior margin and some posterior and anterior margin  the anterior margin abuts some blue ink  P  medial end of the specimen submitted en face  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast final shave margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm portion of breast tissue which is externally unremarkable  The specimen is not oriented and was inked entirely in black 